# 問い7(通知用): この設備のラインの責任者は、指定日に誰か(担当の交代を日付で判定)
SELECT ?employeeId ?role ?line ?from ?until WHERE {
  ?equipment xf:equipmentId "{{EQUIPMENT}}" .
  ?l a s4inma:WorkCenter ;
      saref:consistsOf+ ?equipment ;
      rdfs:label ?line .
  ?assignment a xf:RoleAssignment ;
      xf:scope ?l ;
      org:member / xf:employeeId ?employeeId ;
      org:role / rdfs:label ?role ;
      xf:validFrom ?from .
  OPTIONAL { ?assignment xf:validUntil ?until }
  FILTER (?from <= "{{DATE}}"^^xsd:date && (!BOUND(?until) || "{{DATE}}"^^xsd:date <= ?until))
}
